<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51747" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθεξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>holding, retention</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἀρχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.47
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν μνήμῃ καὶ καθέξει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.968c
				</span></i>
			; <i>possession</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.1.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>holding in, restraining</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πνεύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Somn.Vig.</u>
					456a16
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμοῦ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EE</u>
				1223b20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>retentive power</i>, of the bladder, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>.</div>
